---
import Section from "../layout/Section.astro";
import Container from "../layout/Container.astro";
---

<Section>

  <Container>

    <header class="section-header">

      <h2>Research Vision</h2>

    </header>

    <div class="research-vision">

      <p>

        The NeuroTopology Group develops mathematical foundations for
        understanding neuronal structure and brain networks. We seek
        mathematical principles that describe how neuronal morphology,
        geometry and topology contribute to the organization of neural
        systems across multiple spatial scales.

      </p>

      <p>

        Our research combines mathematics, computational neuroscience
        and artificial intelligence to transform neuronal morphology
        into quantitative representations that can be analysed,
        compared and modelled across species, brain regions and
        biological conditions.

      </p>

      <p>

        By connecting theoretical mathematics with large-scale
        neuroanatomical data, we aim to establish general mathematical
        frameworks that bridge individual neurons, neuronal
        populations and brain-wide connectivity.

      </p>

    </div>

  </Container>

</Section>